    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const fields = $input.first().json.body?.data?.fields ?? [];\nconst get = (label) => {\n  const f = fields.find((x) => x.label === label);\n  const v = f?.value;\n  return v === null || v === undefined ? \"\" : String(v).replace(/<[^>]*>/g, \"\").trim();\n};\nconst esc = (s) => s.replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\").replace(/</g, \"&lt;\").replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\");\nconst formatPhone = (p) => {\n  const m = p.replace(/[^\\d+]/g, \"\").match(/^\\+1(\\d{3})(\\d{3})(\\d{4})$/);\n  return m ? `+1 ${m[1]} ${m[2]}-${m[3]}` : p;\n};\n\nconst lead = {\n  name: get(\"Full name\"),\n  email: get(\"Email address\").toLowerCase(),\n  phone: formatPhone(get(\"Phone number\")),\n  company: get(\"Company\"),\n  message: get(\"How can we help?\"),\n  submittedAt: $input.first().json.body?.data?.createdAt ?? new Date().toISOString(),\n};\n\nlead.telegramText =\n  `🔔 <b>New Lead</b>\\n` +\n  `<b>Name:</b> ${esc(lead.name)}\\n` +\n  `<b>Email:</b> ${esc(lead.email)}\\n` +\n  `<b>Phone:</b> ${esc(lead.phone || \"—\")}\\n` +\n  `<b>Company:</b> ${esc(lead.company || \"—\")}\\n` +\n  `<b>Message:</b> ${esc(lead.message)}`;\n\nreturn [{ json: lead }];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -944,
        -624
      ],
      "id": "ed40c6e1-1502-4b48-b2d9-8da842b5926e",
      "name": "Parse + Clean Lead Data"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🎯 Capture Web Form Leads → Sheet + Instant Alerts\n\n**Who it's for:** small teams collecting leads from a web form that want each lead saved and the team pinged in real time — no manual copy-paste.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Form Submission (Tally) — Webhook** receives the form POST.\n2. **Parse + Clean Lead Data (Code)** normalizes name, email, phone, company, message.\n3. **Save Lead to Google Sheets** appends the lead as a new row.\n4. **Notify Owner (Telegram)** + **Notify Team (Slack)** fire instant alerts.\n\n### Setup steps\n1. Connect **Google Sheets** (OAuth2) → your spreadsheet/sheet.\n2. Connect **Telegram**, set `chatId` (placeholder `<YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID>`).\n3. Connect **Slack**, set the destination channel.\n4. Paste this **Webhook** URL into your Tally form's webhook integration.\n5. Send a test submission, confirm a clean run, then **activate**.",
        "height": 532,
        "width": 624
      },
